---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Logo from "../components/Logo.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — troniti">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24">
    <div class="mb-12 flex justify-center">
      <Logo size="lg" />
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-muted">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-8 text-text-muted">
      <section>
        <p>troniti (this website, troniti.com, and the client application at app.troniti.com) is a non-custodial TRON yield-management service. This policy explains the limited information we process when you visit. troniti is non-custodial: we never hold your funds or private keys, and we do not have access to your wallet.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-text">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>This site does not require an account and does not ask you for personal data. In the app, you sign in with your TRON wallet: we process your public wallet address and public on-chain data about it — never your keys.</p>
        <p class="mt-2">We use Google Analytics to understand aggregate usage (pages visited, device type, approximate region). We do not run advertising trackers. Standard server logs may be retained by our hosting providers.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-text">How We Use This Data</h2>
        <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-1">
          <li>To operate the service: showing your wallet's position, income, and billing in the app</li>
          <li>To understand aggregate usage and improve the site's content and presentation</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">We do not sell your data and we do not display advertising on this site.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-text">Your Choices</h2>
        <p>You can block analytics with standard browser tools (content blockers); the site and the app work fully without it. Your on-chain data is public by nature of the blockchain; disconnecting your wallet and revoking the permission ends the service relationship at any time.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-text">Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this policy, reach us on X at <a href="https://x.com/ahmlvs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">@ahmlvs</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-text">&larr; Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
